{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600160","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1360016001:2":{"text":"「逐夜」の夜、あなたたちは女神像の下に集まり、聖石町の住民たちと「開陽」の訪れを待ちわびた。","source_cn":"“逐夜”当晚，你们齐聚一堂，在女神像下，与圣石镇的居民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5F5D17C430CF99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360016002:0":{"text":"てっきり今夜は会えないと思ったぞ、友よ。","source_cn":"还以为会错过你们呢，老朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82EFB2D285FDD100","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360016003:1":{"text":"そんなわけないじゃないですか、将軍！こういう大事な日は、<male>マスター</male><female>マスター</female>は必ずここに戻って来ますよ！","source_cn":"你还不了解主人吗，将军！无论什么节日，<male>他<...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB7E718163F8A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そんなわけないじゃないですか、将軍！こういう大事な日は、<male>マスター</male><female>マスター</female>は必ずここに戻って来ますよ！","female":"そんなわけないじゃないですか、将軍！こういう大事な日は、<male>マスター</male><female>マスター</female>は必ずここに戻って来ますよ！","variant_male_record_index":"151556","variant_female_record_index":"151557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360016004:1":{"text":"そして、その度に新しいお友だちを連れてくるんだよな、はははっ！","source_cn":"而且还经常会为我们带来一些新朋友，哈哈哈哈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8198AF75D70D3569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360016005:0":{"text":"いつでも暁の炎をみんなに届ける準備はできてるわ。","source_cn":"我已经准备好给大家带来晨曦的焰光了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x172C88D4EAD7AABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360016006:1":{"text":"あっ！そろそろ時間ですよ！みなさん、カウントダウンを始めましょう！","source_cn":"啊，快到时间了！大家，准备倒计时！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9388F46C9532700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360016007:0":{"text":"五、四、三、二、一――","source_cn":"5、4、3、2、1——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7B130A31AF1B8CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1360016008:1":{"text":"カウントダウンが終わった瞬間、タレンが飛び上がるよりも先に、一本の眩い流光が夜空を横切った――","source_cn":"在倒计时结束的瞬间，一道绚丽无比的流光居然抢在塔琳之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9059BD57D27B5229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360016009:1":{"text":"あれは、サジタリスの槍！？あの目立ちたがり！よくも私より先に……っ！","source_cn":"那是萨基塔里斯的长矛？！居然被他抢先了！那个爱出风头的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x447311768B16E4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360016010:1":{"text":"自分も負けてはいられないと飛び立つタレン。次の瞬間、鮮やかで華やかな炎が、回旋しながら夜空を貫いて舞い上がった……","source_cn":"塔琳不甘示弱，下一秒，无比鲜艳的华美火焰盘旋破空而上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885E967729B9DF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360016011:1":{"text":"人々の歓声の中、花火が次々と打ち上げられる――","source_cn":"随即，在大家的欢呼声中，烟火燃起——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB27CA99E2C848E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1360016012:0":{"text":"開陽の始まりだ！","source_cn":"开阳之时，到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD86A123D7D38EA53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360016013:1":{"text":"よほほほっ！どうよ、ワシの特大花火は！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，我的大烟花就是不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820CB2B13A90F1E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360016014:1":{"text":"春焔おめでとうございます、フーキンさん！","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐啊，呼金大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF29879A14CBAA1AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1360016015:1":{"text":"さあ、明かりをともして、開陽を祝うよ！","source_cn":"点起灯来，庆祝开阳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x857DD80CA3C0A11A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1360016016:1":{"text":"春焔の祝いの始まりだあ！","source_cn":"春焰庆开始了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B12844231D757F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1360016017:0":{"text":"春焔おめでとうございます、みなさん！","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐！孩子们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D76E5ADAE01FAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1360016018:1":{"text":"今年の花火は格別だな。","source_cn":"今年的烟花真是与众不同啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4916DAC29080661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1360016019:0":{"text":"おい、何をボーッとしてる！早くかかれ！","source_cn":"别愣着，你们这帮笨蛋，继续上啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E499DEBB4929D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1360016020:1":{"text":"現在、ブラックロアーの戦士がやや劣勢か――","source_cn":"现在黑嚎部族的战士暂时处于劣势——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33FD954BC7386A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1360016021:1":{"text":"綺麗だなあ！ルル、絵をいっぱい描くんだ！","source_cn":"好漂亮，噜噜要画好多画！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05553E6839B10B6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1360016022:1":{"text":"へへ、綺麗やろ？今年の花火はワイも協力したんやで！","source_cn":"嘿嘿，好看吧？这次的烟火可有我的功劳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5A63F99A82E425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1360016023:1":{"text":"へえ、なかなか見応えがあるじゃねえか。テミシアのやつ、今頃なにしてっかな……","source_cn":"哼，还挺漂亮的嘛，不知道特弥希娅那家伙现在在干什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6316A965FB6E8E2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1360016024:1":{"text":"じいちゃん、ばあちゃん！早く！花火が始まったよ！","source_cn":"爷爷，奶奶，放烟花了，快出来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34357ACF5244E059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1360016025:0":{"text":"ふっ、実に賑やかだな。","source_cn":"呵呵，真是热闹啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B8311B412982C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1360016026:0":{"text":"春焔の祝いの始まりだ。みんな春焔おめでとう！","source_cn":"春焰庆正式开始了——春焰庆快乐啊，各位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB407E7397C9346D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","d